    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d738">

                <pb facs="0671" n="555" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 815.51/169 a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-01-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 16, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The text of the loan convention sent you January 3 is entirely accurate except
                    last paragraph should read “Done in duplicate at Washington this tenth day of
                    January one thousand nine hundred and eleven” and [the same in Spanish]; and is
                    signed “Philander C. Knox, Juan E. Paredes.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
